WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.085
Some people like to watch bonus content -

00:00:02.085 --> 00:00:03.586
- You are the bonus content…
- Check it out…

00:00:03.586 --> 00:00:05.422
You are the living bonus content.
- There you go.

00:00:05.422 --> 00:00:06.506
It says that on my business card.

00:00:08.091 --> 00:00:09.300
Welcome to Monarch, General.

00:00:13.054 --> 00:00:14.973
This is gonna give me nightmares.

00:00:17.058 --> 00:00:18.351
[MONSTER ROARS]

00:00:18.435 --> 00:00:20.270
One of the things
that really appealed to us was that,

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:23.356
before now, 
you’re always inside Monarch.

00:00:23.356 --> 00:00:24.357
- Everybody gets a parka.

00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:26.776
Yeah, exactly, everybody
has the branded Monarch gear.

00:00:26.776 --> 00:00:29.571
And what we wanted to do
was to turn the perspective around

00:00:29.571 --> 00:00:32.115
and have a group of characters
who were on the outside looking in.

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:35.326
- What’s Monarch?

00:00:35.326 --> 00:00:36.327
- I don’t know.

00:00:36.327 --> 00:00:39.581
- Monarch is just as unknown and monstrous…
- And scary!

00:00:39.581 --> 00:00:41.082
Are these guys
good guys or bad guys?

00:00:41.082 --> 00:00:42.083
We don’t know.

00:00:42.083 --> 00:00:44.627
- The whole city was coming down...

00:00:44.627 --> 00:00:46.129
These guys were taking pictures.

00:00:46.129 --> 00:00:47.505
- We want to pull back the curtain on that

00:00:47.505 --> 00:00:51.259
and show you how it became
the organization that you now see.

00:00:52.135 --> 00:00:55.096
- We have to bring Monarch
out of the shadows.

00:00:56.639 --> 00:00:58.850
- Going into the Monsterverse,
we had to figure out

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:00.560
what’s the best version of the show.

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:03.396
The first question I asked was,
does it have to be about the monsters?

00:01:03.396 --> 00:01:05.356
I think it should be about
this messed up family.

00:01:05.356 --> 00:01:09.527
And it’s that journey that takes you
into the world of the monsters.

00:01:09.819 --> 00:01:10.528
[YELLS]

00:01:10.528 --> 00:01:13.656
[MONSTERS ROARING]

00:01:13.656 --> 00:01:15.283
- In this new world,

00:01:15.283 --> 00:01:16.576
monsters are like hurricanes,

00:01:16.576 --> 00:01:18.870
it’s a reality of the world you live in.

00:01:18.870 --> 00:01:22.248
Let’s tell a story about people
with that as the backdrop.

00:01:22.248 --> 00:01:24.542
A lot of the Monsterverse
fans are going to come for

00:01:24.542 --> 00:01:27.420
the Titans, they’re going to come for
cities being knocked down,

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:29.797
but the show will be about people
getting back up again.

00:01:30.131 --> 00:01:33.301
- The only way out is through.

00:01:33.510 --> 00:01:37.055
- Our internal shorthand has been like,
it’s not a 9/11 show, it’s a 9/12 show.

00:01:37.514 --> 00:01:40.225
It’s about the first time you had to take
your shoes off at the airport.

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:42.185
- This changes everything.

00:01:43.102 --> 00:01:44.687
- It’s a story about the Titans,

00:01:44.687 --> 00:01:47.523
but also about a group of people
who are dealing with their own monsters.

00:01:47.523 --> 00:01:48.942
Everybody’s dealing with 
their own monsters.

00:01:48.942 --> 00:01:50.443
- It is your family business.

00:01:50.443 --> 00:01:51.694
- It’s the family curse.

00:01:52.862 --> 00:01:56.032
- Over the season, we hop
from era to era,

00:01:56.032 --> 00:01:58.243
and fill in more of the blanks,
but not all of them.

00:01:58.243 --> 00:02:02.956
So we still have questions to answer,
and we’re asking even more

00:02:02.956 --> 00:02:04.123
that push everything forward.

00:02:04.123 --> 00:02:05.625
- If you come with me,

00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:07.961
you’ll know everything,
I promise you.

00:02:09.420 --> 00:02:11.005
- Oh my God, go go go!

